__pycache__/
.env
.venv
account.json
.*
CLAUDE.md

# Keep the subagents/skills built for this project under version control —
# the ".*" pattern above would otherwise exclude them along with real dotfiles.
!.claude/
!.claude/**

# The ".*" pattern above also self-matches this file — negate it so the
# ignore rules themselves are actually shared via the repo, not local-only.
!.gitignore